#N canvas 40 40 840 760 12;
#X text 20 12 [af.play~] - play a sound file from disk;
#X text 20 38 Streams the file rather than loading it into an array
\, with start and stop \, looping \, variable speed \, seeking and position
reporting. The creation argument is the number of signal outlets \,
2 by default. A file with a different channel count is mixed to it.;
#X obj 30 122 bng 19 250 50 0 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 #fcfcfc #000000
#000000;
#X text 58 123 pick a file to open;
